# Android / Gradle
# NOTE: android/app/src/ (Manifest, Java sources, resources) and the project
# Gradle config below are real, hand-maintained project source — they must
# stay tracked so a fresh checkout can build the app. Only genuinely local/
# generated/cache paths are ignored here; android/.gitignore and
# android/app/.gitignore already cover build output, the copied web bundle,
# and auto-regenerated capacitor.config.json/capacitor.plugins.json/config.xml.
android/.gradle-user-home/
